# Trivy ignore list: advisories in the root poetry.lock that no relock can fix.
# Each entry expires, so Trivy reports it again once the date passes and
# someone has to check whether a fix exists by then. Every other advisory in the
# root poetry.lock had a fixed release and was lifted by floors in pyproject.toml
# (plan 2026-11-05-python-bridge-pillow-and-aiohttp-advisories-are-capped-by-qontinui-core).

